# AgentShip demo — provider credentials template.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   # then edit .env and fill in a real key
#
# The `agentship run` CLI loads a `.env` from the current directory automatically,
# so a running agent picks up whatever you set here. This file (.env.example) is
# committed as a template; your filled-in `.env` is gitignored and must never be
# committed.
#
# The demo agent (agents/assistant.yaml) uses openai/gpt-4o-mini, so it needs:

# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# The test suite does NOT need a key — it replays a recorded cassette (see README).
